A||||10||mrfixit58||More PICS from the Daytona Show||||6||
Z||000000||mrfixit58||03-27-2000||01:34 PM||||I see Spyder bet me to the punch. But here are some pics he didn't show...<BR>FIEROS,FIEROS EVERYWHERE!!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/view1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/view2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/view3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/winner.jpg"> <BR>The car above was in the lead for the Best Modified when I last heard. The color is "black Rose" from the 40th anniversity Vette. I gave him a Pennock's card, maybe we'll hear from him.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blkflams_1.jpg"> <P>The car above got my vote for the best "Theme" (in my opinion). All black and silver. Check out his front speaker covers in the pic below:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blkflms2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sleeper.jpg"> <BR>Why would I post the above car, you may ask... Well, he got my vote for the "best sleeper car", See below:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sleepmot.jpg"> <BR>That's right, a DOHC 3.4 with a backyard install (note the dog bone is made from a threaded rod).<BR>Bet it screams...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PHIL.jpg"> <BR>Above is our own PHIL. He is the guy in the Aussie hat. I a Enjoyed meeting him. Below is a pic of his SC3800:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PHILmotr.jpg"> <P>Note the high tech hood prop-rod. Somehow, it fits PHIL's personallity perfectly.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I took a few more but now you've seen the highlights. I wish I'd met more of you but maybe next year. I had a few of Pennock's Fiero Forum business cards in my hat band but wound up giving most of them away. Maybe we'll hear from some new members. <P>Enjoy,<BR>Roy L.<P>||||reg||6
Z||000001||ChadMan||03-27-2000||01:59 PM||||Wow, great pics!  Did you guys get to take a parade lap or anything?  That banking would be wild.||||reg||1
Z||000002||sdm1964||03-27-2000||02:06 PM||||Hey you got a pic of my car in there!!! It was really nice to meet you and i had a blast!! As soon as i get the you, me and phill developed i will post it. We all had a great time, wish more of you could have been there..||||reg||14
Z||000003||mrfixit58||03-27-2000||03:37 PM||||Hey sdm1964,<P>I think I also got you in the pictre. Aren't you that tall drink-of-water next to that(your) white w/ black ground effects SE (third group photo, right side)?<P>Now, if Spyder can pick himself out of the crowd....<P>Roy L.<BR>||||reg||12
Z||000004||Spyder||03-27-2000||05:52 PM||||I think I see my foot!<BR>Nope, not mine.<BR>The funny thing, I probably walked right by some of you guys.<BR>Then again, y'all probably recognized me and just laughed, “look there goes Spyder”. Just kidding.||||reg||6
