Z||000006||sdm1964||03-28-2000||05:34 AM||||yep i am the tall funny looking guy but i have a white and black 85GT. I think i will make a sign to put in front of the car next time, so we all can meetand sign it. phill had the thing on his antenna. need something bigger to advertise this fine sight and i won't miss anyone.Let me see if i can cruise around the country and ship my car overseas in 2 or 3 years i could get all the members of the forum to sign it.||||reg||14
Z||000007||mrfixit58||03-28-2000||07:37 PM||||I'm like a kid witha new toy.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I just figured out how to  post all my Daytona pictures on PhotoPoint. Just click on the URL below. Some of them you've already seen but, there are several select Fieros shown and even a few others that I liked.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=446733&a=3289275" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=446733&a=3289275</A> <P>Enjoy,<BR>Roy||||reg||1
