Z||000010||Old Lar||03-29-2000||09:11 PM||||Nice photos..  I'll try to add mine to that  photo website.  I have to convert the digital images to .jpg format.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>No parade laps.  Daytona discontinued that activity two years ago.  You need to be at 70 mph to get up on the bank, but Daytonaa would only let you do no more than 40 mph.   Insurance cost if some nut hurt themselves on the track.  I got a photo going across the finish line when they did let you run.<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 03-29-2000).]||||reg||6
